      },
      "worked": "Reciprocal true bearings differ by $180^\\circ$.\n\nFor $0^\\circ\\leq\\theta<180^\\circ$, the bearing of $B$ from $A$ is $\\theta+180^\\circ$.\n\nFor $180^\\circ\\leq\\theta<360^\\circ$, it is $\\theta-180^\\circ$, keeping the true bearing in the range $0^\\circ\\leq b<360^\\circ$.",
